    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "8BC7207E364EB1D7",
      "text": "¿Has venido a comer?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "8BC7217E364EB38A",
      "text": "¿Estás cocinando?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_02",
      "hash64": "D2ED3388983CE6C1",
      "text": "No, qué va. Nada de eso.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_03",
      "hash64": "D2ED3288983CE50E",
      "text": "Es que, hace un momento, iba por el vestíbulo...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_04",
      "hash64": "D2ED3588983CEA27",
      "text": "¡Y de repente he notado que alguien me estaba\\nmirando, como te conté el otro día![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_05",
      "hash64": "D2ED3488983CE874",
      "text": "Así que, como el comedor estaba cerca, me he\\nmetido corriendo.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_06",
      "hash64": "D2ED3788983CED8D",
      "text": "Aquí solo hay una puerta para entrar y salir, así\\nque he pensado que, si quienquiera que sea me\\r\\nseguía, podría por fin revelar su identidad.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_07",
      "hash64": "D2ED3688983CEBDA",
      "text": "¡Ah! ¡Viene alguien![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_woman_01",
      "hash64": "F42347F9AB47717F",
      "text": "¿Eh? Qué raro... Me había parecido verla entrar\\naquí.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_woman_02",
      "hash64": "F42348F9AB477332",
      "text": "He vuelto a perder la oportunidad de hacerle\\nesa pregunta...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_08",
      "hash64": "D2ED2988983CD5C3",
      "text": "Esa chica me suena. Creo que ya la he visto más\\nde una vez.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_09",
      "hash64": "D2ED2888983CD410",
      "text": "Parece ser una alumna, pero su pregunta quizá\\nno tenga que ver con los estudios...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_10",
      "hash64": "D2E9AB889839C9D2",
      "text": "La próxima vez que la vea, intentaré hablar yo\\ncon ella.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_11",
      "hash64": "D2E9AC889839CB85",
      "text": "La verdad es que estaba un poco asustada...\\nGracias por hacerme compañía, criatura.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_system_01",
      "hash64": "14795A4C3BC6A7F4",
      "text": "¡Te has granjeado la confianza de Mila!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
